From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mdk: signal the viewer when its compositor parent dies

The viewer normally quits through its RemoteDesktop disconnect callbacks.
It creates its own session with setsid(), so compositor process-group
cleanup does not own the activated viewer.

Install PR_SET_PDEATHSIG(SIGTERM) for the direct child as a termination
fallback independent of D-Bus delivery and viewer main-loop progress.
Check the parent PID after setup to cover death before signal installation,
and exit before exec if the lifetime link cannot be established.

The spawning thread is the compositor main thread. Keep HAVE_SYS_PRCTL
guards and allocation-free child setup. SIGTERM delivery does not promise
unconditional bounded exit or reaping. This safeguard alone does not
establish the cause or resolution of the historical orphan in #191.

---
diff --git a/src/core/meta-mdk.c b/src/core/meta-mdk.c
--- a/src/core/meta-mdk.c
+++ b/src/core/meta-mdk.c
@@ -20,6 +20,12 @@
 
 #include "config.h"
 
+#ifdef HAVE_SYS_PRCTL
+#include <signal.h>
+#include <sys/prctl.h>
+#include <unistd.h>
+#endif
+
 #include "core/meta-mdk.h"
 
 #include "backends/meta-remote-desktop.h"
@@ -52,6 +58,21 @@
   GSubprocess *devkit_process;
   GCancellable *devkit_process_cancellable;
 };
+
+#ifdef HAVE_SYS_PRCTL
+static void
+set_devkit_parent_death_signal (gpointer user_data)
+{
+  pid_t expected_parent = GPOINTER_TO_INT (user_data);
+
+  /* The parent may have exited between fork() and installing the signal.
+   * Fail closed if the lifetime link cannot be established.
+   */
+  if (prctl (PR_SET_PDEATHSIG, SIGTERM) < 0 ||
+      getppid () != expected_parent)
+    _exit (127);
+}
+#endif
 
 G_DEFINE_TYPE (MetaMdk, meta_mdk, G_TYPE_OBJECT)
 
@@ -140,6 +161,14 @@
     }
 
   launcher = g_subprocess_launcher_new (G_SUBPROCESS_FLAGS_NONE);
+#ifdef HAVE_SYS_PRCTL
+  /* PDEATHSIG follows the creating thread. The enabled signals dispatch from
+   * the D-Bus name-owner context on the long-lived compositor main thread.
+   */
+  g_subprocess_launcher_set_child_setup (launcher,
+                                         set_devkit_parent_death_signal,
+                                         GINT_TO_POINTER (getpid ()), NULL);
+#endif
 
   if (mdk->external_wayland_display)
     {
